5. One important thing about your current search

Your existing handleSearch() does:

options.filter((item) =>
  item?.name?.toLowerCase().includes(this.searchValue)
)

So the demo response still behaves like a real search.

For example:

Search: "mum"
        ↓
Mumbai only

and:

Search: "del"
        ↓
Delhi only

This is good because you're testing the actual autocomplete behavior rather than simply displaying all five locations.


